      "header": "Learn by running on SaaS",
      "description": "Start in minutes with the agent and tools already configured. Enable the Camunda-provided LLM connection in your organization if needed, then explore the included Test Studio scenarios without setting up your own API keys. Internet access is required. Setup guide: https://docs.camunda.io/docs/components/agentic-orchestration/camunda-provided-llm/#set-up-camunda-provided-llm",
