      "header": "Learn from the Self-Managed example",
      "description": "Use the BPMN and forms as a reference for your own Camunda installation, with a supported AI provider of your choice.",
      "hideOnOverview": false,
      "position": 2,
      "characteristics": []
    },
    {
      "id": "6717701",
      "refId": "14432678-1896-4642-b758-c6810697652e",
      "header": "Learn through local tests",
      "description": "Explore deterministic Camunda Process Test (CPT) scenarios in the repository without calling an LLM. To experiment with the agent locally, configure a supported local LLM or an existing provider. CPT tests stay in the repository, outside the Hub import.",
